# MCP Tool Preferences

## Documentation

Use the **context7-plugin** MCP server (`plugin-context7-plugin-context7`) to look up library and framework documentation instead of web searches or guessing APIs.

## Figma

Use the **Figma** MCP server (`plugin-figma-figma`) for any Figma-related tasks: inspecting designs, fetching component data, and implementing UI from Figma files.
